# Exception: AWS-Insurance-FNOL-Voice-Agentic-AI ships its Claude config as a
# project artifact (constraint 15 / Definition of Done — a fresh clone must get
# .claude/mcp.json so the local MCP servers are invocable without extra setup).
# settings.local.json stays ignored. Scoped deliberately so sibling projects,
# which keep .claude local-only, are unaffected.
!AWS-Insurance-FNOL-Voice-Agentic-AI/.claude/
AWS-Insurance-FNOL-Voice-Agentic-AI/.claude/*
!AWS-Insurance-FNOL-Voice-Agentic-AI/.claude/settings.json
!AWS-Insurance-FNOL-Voice-Agentic-AI/.claude/mcp.json
!AWS-Insurance-FNOL-Voice-Agentic-AI/.claude/skills/
